  * debian/control: Remove the redundant Priority: optional and
    Rules-Requires-Root: no fields, which are now the dpkg defaults.
  * debian/rules: Enable all hardening flags, adding bindnow.
  * debian/watch: Convert to version 5 format using the GitHub template.

